# The nine materials and the halfway points between them (P1 0, 16, 32 .. 255 in steps of 16), a three-note
# phrase each at P2 128 on the sample track: wood, marimba, xylophone, vibes, glock, steel drum, bell, gong, glass.
tempo 160
steps 144
tail 1.5
track sample
preset 0 128 0 0 255 0 0 0 128 0 128 200 0 128 100 255 0 0
param p1 0 0
note 0 53 1 120
note 2 60 1 100
note 4 69 1 110
param p1 16 8
note 8 53 1 120
note 10 60 1 100
note 12 69 1 110
param p1 32 16
note 16 53 1 120
note 18 60 1 100
note 20 69 1 110
