note 50 60 1 100
note 52 69 1 110
param p1 112 56
note 56 53 1 120
note 58 60 1 100
note 60 69 1 110
param p1 128 64
note 64 53 1 120
note 66 60 1 100
note 68 69 1 110
param p1 144 72
note 72 53 1 120
note 74 60 1 100
note 76 69 1 110
param p1 160 80
note 80 53 1 120
note 82 60 1 100
note 84 69 1 110
