# end: two dead wood hits per track, together, steal the ringing voices (they fade in 2.9 ms, the wood ends at once)
track sample
param p1 0 136
param p2 0 136
note 140 53 1 90
note 140 53 1 90
expect sound 0 136
expect peak_below 0
expect idle 150
